      "content": "but assigning value is just an illusion. it's just a way to distract yourself from the fact that the equation is already settled. if the net value is zero, then stopping the process isn't a \"loss,\" it's just balancing the equation. it's actually more logical to just stop than to keep trying to invent reasons to continue. dont you see how much more efficient that is?",
